  _senarioDescription: "You don't even give it a second thought. Your flight instinct
    is so strong that you just book it out that back door not even looking back for
    a moment. Before you even knew it you were already in the nearby town. You managed
    to find your way to the sheriff\u2019s office who were thankfully open late because
    of halloween. They informed you that you could sleep here for the night and that
    they would check it out in the morning. When morning came you and the sheriff
    returned to your home where nothing was found. The only clue to anything was
    the footprint that left the sheriff stumped. Leaving you not only concerned for
    its potential return and embarrassed that the sheriff thinks you're crazy now. 
    \\nRun forest - Ending "
